# PostgreSQL exclusivo de la supervisión (Zabbix 7.0 LTS). Rootless, en el
# usuario de servicio: ~/.config/containers/systemd/.
# Clave: `podman secret create vec-supervision-pg-clave <fichero>`, fuera de Git.
[Unit]
Description=VEC supervisión: PostgreSQL de Zabbix

[Container]
ContainerName=vec-supervision-pg
Image=docker.io/library/postgres@sha256:77f585114c32fbca283dc835b0596f4e52b51b4c6662d7810b2f4084f60a1873
Network=vec-supervision-datos.network
Volume=vec-supervision-pg.volume:/var/lib/postgresql
Secret=vec-supervision-pg-clave,type=mount,target=/run/secrets/pg_clave
Environment=POSTGRES_USER=zabbix POSTGRES_DB=zabbix POSTGRES_PASSWORD_FILE=/run/secrets/pg_clave
# PG_AJUSTES de recursos.env.
Exec=postgres -c shared_buffers=128MB -c effective_cache_size=256MB -c work_mem=4MB -c maintenance_work_mem=32MB -c max_connections=60 -c wal_buffers=4MB -c max_wal_size=512MB -c min_wal_size=64MB -c checkpoint_completion_target=0.9 -c synchronous_commit=off -c autovacuum_max_workers=2 -c random_page_cost=1.1 -c jit=off
# Límites (recursos.env): PG_CPUS, PG_MEMORIA, PG_PIDS, CUOTA_CPU_RELATIVA.
PodmanArgs=--cpus=1.0 --memory=768m --memory-swap=768m --pids-limit=128 --cpu-shares=256
# E/S (PG_ESCRITURA_BPS/PG_LECTURA_BPS): solo tiene efecto si el controlador io
# está delegado al usuario (README, «rootless»). Sustituir <disco>:
# PodmanArgs=--device-write-bps=/dev/<disco>:20mb --device-read-bps=/dev/<disco>:50mb
NoNewPrivileges=true

[Service]
Nice=10
IOSchedulingClass=best-effort
IOSchedulingPriority=7
Restart=on-failure
TimeoutStartSec=300

[Install]
WantedBy=default.target
